+- Required node metadata is missing or inconsistent, including absent memory entries for candidate nodes, unavailable network metadata needed for the requested instance type, or ambiguous topology cycles.
+- Required model-card or config-validation metadata is missing or incompatible, including absent `storage_size`, `n_layers`, `hidden_size`, incompatible tensor divisibility, disabled/unsupported sharding metadata, enabled MTP, or missing text-only MiMo V2 causal LM validation evidence.
+- Any Pro request metadata contains image, video, audio, multimodal, omnimodal, media processor, media token, or media capability markers; media-bearing Pro placement requests must fail closed before scheduling and must not be converted into best-effort text placements.
