+
+All failure examples are Pro-specific and fail closed. They must not be implemented as media stripping, caption extraction, media URL fetching, processor fallback, or best-effort text-only inference.
+
+## Required text-only model-card assertions and fail-closed media rejections
+
+Every `XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-V2.5-Pro` model-card or exo registry entry added by Track A must make these positive text-only capability assertions:
+
+- The exact model identifier is `XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-V2.5-Pro`; aliases or families must not broaden validation to non-Pro models.
+- The supported task family is text generation / causal LM only, suitable for plain text chat, agentic prompting, and long-context token generation.
+- The metadata may describe text-core implementation requirements such as MLX, MiMo V2 causal LM architecture, FP8 E4M3, MoE routing, hybrid full/SWA attention, disabled MTP, tokenizer compatibility, and long-context config validation.
+- Capability fields for image, video, audio, multimodal, and omnimodal input or output are absent or explicitly false.
+- Any request guard or dry validation result for Pro reports unsupported media requests as a validation failure before model loading, not as a best-effort text fallback.
+
+The same model-card or registry validation must reject Pro metadata fail-closed when any of these media-bearing indicators appear:
+
+- Image metadata, including `image-to-text`, `image-text-to-text`, `visual-question-answering`, `vision`, `vision_config`, `vision_tower`, image processors, image token placeholders, or image input/output capability booleans.
+- Video metadata, including `text-to-video`, `video-text-to-text`, `video`, `video_config`, video adapters/decoders, video token placeholders, or video input/output capability booleans.
+- Audio metadata, including `audio-text-to-text`, `automatic-speech-recognition`, `text-to-audio`, `audio`, `audio_config`, audio encoders/decoders, audio token placeholders, or audio input/output capability booleans.
+- Multimodal or omnimodal metadata, including `multimodal`, `omnimodal`, generic processor classes that accept media payloads, mixed-media chat-template markers, or capability lists that combine text with image/video/audio support.
+- Ambiguous metadata that cannot prove text-only causal LM behavior for Pro from already-present lightweight files. Ambiguity is unsupported for Track A and must stop before downloads, weight materialization, tokenizer/model construction, inference, or live-runtime changes.
+
+These assertions and rejection cases are Pro-specific. They must not change existing model-card interpretation, request validation, or media behavior for non-`XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-V2.5-Pro` models.
+
+## Media exclusion
+
+MiMo-V2.5-Pro remains unsupported for media-bearing requests in this Track A slice. Any request path that supplies image, video, audio, multimodal, or omnimodal inputs for Pro must remain unsupported or fail closed before inference. Non-Pro model behavior is not changed by this document or by the Pro-only validation scaffolding.
